{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "施了魔法的夜晚过去，隔天。", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“──真的非常对不起！”", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "sn6804", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我看到了我的恋人下跪。", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我居然得意忘形地一个接一个夺走新吾同学的第一次，最后还让他在外过夜──”", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "sn6805", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没有错！我要向你道歉小樱乃！我把你重要的哥哥毁了……”", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "sn6806", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“小樱乃、小樱乃！至少让我看到你！让我当面道歉！”", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "sn6807", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“纱凪、纱凪，你先冷静下来吧。”", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪对着樱乃的房间门下跪，我看不下去地拍拍她的肩膀安抚她。", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……昨晚我们一起入睡，然后早晨一起醒来。", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "从那个时候我就觉得她看起来怪怪的。首先，她满脸通红地从床上跳下来。", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后迅速穿上衣服（就是现在身上这套男装），像在赶火车似的催促我梳洗准备回家……", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在她说“我也一起去！”的时候我就应该察觉到了才对，可是我没有。", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……醒来后，就像魔法解除一样，各种意义上都回过神来。", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "毕竟昨天是那么特别的日子。正因为如此，所以我也努力表现得和平常一样……", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“樱乃今天代替我们跟濑名同学去社团了。”", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸……？啊……是这样啊。那……呃，已经……”", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "sn6808", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，现在应该已经在学校了。”", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是、是这样啊，她不在家……”", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "_sn4532", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以说，我们两人独处！？”", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "_sn4533", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就是这样。”", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 172, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "_sn4534", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪的脸瞬间通红，低着头不看我。", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……纱凪的反应我可以理解。", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个……真的很对不起……”", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "_sn4535", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不，其实我也……”", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在各种意义上。", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "要是说破，她大概会拼命跟我道歉吧，所以我也含糊其辞。", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但、但是啊，我不是抱着随随便便的心情就做出那种事还有那种事……”", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "sn6809", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，我知道，我也一样。”", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我非常、非常开心，是人生中最开心的时候。”", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……我也跟你一样开心。虽然现在想起来害羞到想消失……”", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "sn6810", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“自己终于……成为新吾的东西了，心和身体都……确实地感受到了……”", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "sn6811", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……这一点我也一样。”", "text_idx": 177, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "喜欢这个词无法联系的部分。", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在充满了第一次的昨晚，全部都相连了。我到现在也能感受到余韵。", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪成为只属于我的，同时我也成为只属于纱凪的。", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嘿……嘿嘿嘿……”", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "sn6812", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好开心……我还想更多次成为新吾的……”", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "sn6813", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪害羞地说，怯怯地握住我的手。", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也是。”", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……”", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "_sn4540", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“更多更多次，让纱凪成为我的。”", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我抱着纱凪，在她耳边低语。", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她的身体完全倚靠着我。", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我与她的手指交缠，她的身体颤抖了一下。", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……新吾，亲我。”", "text_idx": 175, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "_sn4541", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她的声音饱含热意，我们在极近的距离下凝视彼此。", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然也有做得太过头的部分……", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是确实结合的这个事实果然让我们的某些地方改变了。", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们都想尽可能地碰触对方。", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪也是这么想的，所以主动蹭了蹭我的身体。", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“纱凪。”", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……”", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "_sn4542", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我没有直接吻她的唇，而是亲了脸颊一口。", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "结果纱凪的眼眶立刻盈满泪水。", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不要只有脸颊……要亲亲、要亲亲……”", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "_sn4543", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她扯着我的袖子声音甜蜜，主动把脸靠上来。", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "要吻她很简单。", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是我故意不做，只是看着她。", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾……啾……嗯……”", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "_sn4544", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "于是纱凪便主动吻上了我的唇。", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就如同我希望的那样，一股满足感充斥在胸口。", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "对我来说，纱凪主动的索求能让我感受到她成为了我的。", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……同时，在心里再三确认自己的状态。嗯，只有接吻应该没问题，不会变成像昨晚那样。", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯哈……哈啊……新吾……”", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "sn6814", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……纱凪。”", "text_idx": 176, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊、嗯啾、呼……”", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "sn6815", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以这次换我吻她，将她整个人珍惜地抱在怀中。", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪在我的怀抱中紧绷，可爱地颤抖着。", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她生涩的反应可爱到无以复加，昨晚的结合仿佛是假的一样。", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后嘴唇一分开，纱凪又扭扭捏捏地低下头。", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……怎么办……”", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "sn6816", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“什么怎么办？”", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“接吻……再次感觉到、好厉害……”", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "sn6817", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然做过更厉害的事情了，不过这个行为依然有独特的魅力。", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾，还要……嗯、啾、啾、啾……”", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "sn6818", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪眯起眼睛，在我的脸颊、鼻子上落下一个又一个轻吻。", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "由此就能知道这女孩真的是很喜欢亲吻。", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾，怎么办……我、停不下来……”", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "_sn4548", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……新吾……新吾……”", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "_sn4549", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……纱凪……嗯、啾、嗯……”", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就像玩火的孩子。", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "跟做爱不同，不管索求多少都没有尽头……", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯、嗯、啊姆、啾姆……啾……”", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "sn6819", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪忘我地亲吻，我也同等地回应。", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "真的是没有尽头。", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……等我们回过神来，天色已经要暗了。", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“为什么会变成这样呢，我应该是为了跟小樱乃道歉才去的……”", "text_idx": 181, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "sn6820", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我好像……一直在接吻……”", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "sn6821", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那我也是一样。”", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“明、明明没有打算这样的……啊啊真是的，笨蛋笨蛋，我这个笨蛋……”", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "_sn4552", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们在她家门口拥抱，聊着今天发生的事。", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为一直忍耐的副作用吗？”", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“或许是那样……”", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "_sn4553", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“该不会我是接吻魔？亲过头了？”", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "_sn4554", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一对上视线，她又靠近我的唇。", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪在我的怀抱中踮起脚尖。", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我不稍微忍耐一下的话……好像会一直亲新吾……”", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "sn6822", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“连说话都忘记、一直……”", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "sn6823", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "的确，跟昨天比起来，今天的我们一直在一起但是对话少了许多。", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是……接吻的时候纱凪能安心，疼痛什么的也都忘记了对吧？”", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是、是这样没错……欸你怎么知道！？”", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "sn6824", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“当然知道了，因为一直跟你接吻，一点点的难受我都能立刻感觉到。”", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……真、真是的，我们已经完全学会怎么感受彼此了呢……”", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "sn6825", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她害羞地垂下视线，睫毛看起来很诱人。", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我差点反射性地又去吻她……", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所、所以要更加忍耐才行。要是有理由好像真的会永远亲吻下去……”", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "sn6826", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……你说的对。”", "text_idx": 174, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我忍住了。", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是。", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……但是，分开前再一次。”", "text_idx": 173, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "_sn4556", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这次可以由新吾亲我吗……？”", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "_sn4557", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她甜蜜的呢喃请求，我当然尽全力回应。", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊、嗯呼……嗯、嗯唔、啾咕、咕啾噜、哈嗯、咕啾、咕啾啾、咧啾……嗯……”", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "sn6829", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呼啊、新吾、舌头进来了……已经、已经、这样下去没办法掰掰……嗯啾、嗯嗯……”", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 280, "voice": "sn6830", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我全力过头，于是又这样亲了她快一个小时。", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "对刚学会的亲吻这件事沉迷得无法自拔。", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
